{{#> layout
  title='About'
  url='/about.html'
}}
  <style>
    .about-hero {
      padding-top: 2rem;
      padding-bottom: 3rem;
    }

    .about-photo {
      display: block;
      width: 9rem;
      height: 9rem;
      margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
      border-radius: 50%;
      object-fit: cover;
      border: 4px solid var(--v-color-body-bg);
      box-shadow:
        0 0 0 1px var(--v-color-border-muted),
        0 1rem 2.5rem rgba(var(--v-color-primary-rgb), 0.15);
    }

    .about-eyebrow {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--v-color-primary);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .about-title {
      font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 5.5vw, 3.5rem);
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--v-color-emphasize);
      max-width: 40rem;
      margin: 0 auto 1.25rem;
    }

    .about-lead {
      max-width: 36rem;
      margin: 0 auto;
      font-size: 1.25rem;
    }

    .about-letter {
      position: relative;
      max-width: 40rem;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 2.5rem 3rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--v-color-border-muted);
      border-radius: 1rem;
      background: var(--v-color-body-bg);
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      box-shadow: 0 1.25rem 3rem rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);

      & p {
        margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
      }
    }

    .about-letter-intro {
      font-family: var(--v-headings-font-family);
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      line-height: 1.4;
      color: var(--v-color-emphasize);
    }

    .about-signature {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      margin-top: 2rem;
      padding-top: 1.5rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--v-color-border-muted);
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .about-signature-name {
      font-family: var(--v-headings-font-family);
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--v-color-emphasize);
    }

    .about-signature-role {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    .about-facts {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1.5rem;
      max-width: 52rem;
      margin: 4rem auto 0;

      @media (width >= 768px) {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      }
    }

    .about-fact {
      padding: 1.75rem;
      border-radius: 1rem;
      background: rgba(var(--v-color-primary-rgb), 0.04);
      font-size: 1rem;

      & i {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        width: 2.75rem;
        height: 2.75rem;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        border-radius: 0.75rem;
        background: rgba(var(--v-color-primary-rgb), 0.1);
        color: var(--v-color-primary);
        font-size: 1.25rem;
      }

      & h2 {
        font-size: 1.2rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--v-color-emphasize);
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        letter-spacing: -1px;
      }

      & p {
        margin: 0;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }
    }

    .about-facts-section {
      padding-bottom: 4rem;
    }

    @media (width < 576px) {
      .about-letter {
        padding: 1.75rem 1.5rem;
        font-size: 1rem;
      }

      .about-letter-intro {
        font-size: 1.25rem;
      }
    }
  </style>

  <section class="about-hero container-md text-center">
    <img
      src="assets/about.webp"
      class="about-photo"
      alt="Photo of Dima Sneas"
      width="144"
      height="144"
    />
    <span class="about-eyebrow">About Vocably</span>
    <h1 class="about-title">A dictionary for language learners</h1>
    <p class="about-lead">
      Vocably is an
      <a href="https://github.com/vocably/language-learning-tool" target="_blank" class="link-secondary">open-source</a>
      dictionary and language-learning tool created by a
      <a href="https://sneas.io" target="_blank" class="link-secondary">Ukrainian programmer</a>
      who lives in the Netherlands.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="container-md">
    <article class="about-letter">
      <p class="about-letter-intro">Vocably has helped me become a confident reader.</p>

      <p>
        Now, I’m working on my speaking skills, which are currently
        <a href="https://www.reddit.com/r/learndutch/comments/1mhenyu/this_is_how_i_play_the_dutchman_how_did_i_perform/" target="_blank" class="link-secondary">terrible</a>.
      </p>

      <p>
        I develop Vocably almost exclusively for my own benefit, but it seems
        <a href="https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/15CfNa_Lp1HO5oZDPk4dofJP9cIJexlrnOXvvZ5dcaNo/edit?gid=0#gid=0" target="_blank" class="link-secondary">some other people</a>
        also find the project useful.
      </p>

      <p>
        If you believe that the best way to learn a language is using it in
        daily life, then you might also appreciate Vocably. The app provides a
        cross-platform dictionary and a learning system.
      </p>

      <p>If you have a reason to use a dictionary, then you probably also have a reason to use Vocably.</p>

      <footer class="about-signature">
        <span class="about-signature-name">Dima Sneas</span>
        <span class="about-signature-role">Creator of Vocably</span>
      </footer>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="container-md about-facts-section">
    <div class="about-facts">
      <div class="about-fact">
        <i class="bi bi-github" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <h2>Open source</h2>
        <p>
          The entire code base is public on
          <a href="https://github.com/vocably/language-learning-tool" target="_blank" class="link-secondary">GitHub</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-fact">
        <i class="bi bi-person" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <h2>Independent</h2>
        <p>Designed, built and maintained by one person who uses it every day.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-fact">
        <i class="bi bi-phone" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <h2>Cross-platform</h2>
        <p>Browser extensions, iOS and Android apps, and an online dictionary.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
{{/layout}}
